# Campaign output. The campaign folder (SQLite + config JSON + copied raw CSVs) is data, not
# source, and can be large. §6.1: it is the single source of truth for a run and is kept with the
# experiment, never in version control.
results/
campaigns/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# Exports (§6.2) are regenerated from a campaign folder.
campaign_export.json
campaign_summary.md
pareto_points.csv

